# What soldiers and bandits say (NpcSpeechSystem): npc-speech-{faction}-{category}-{n}, n from 1 up with no gaps.
# Categories: contact (sees an enemy), clear (the fight is over), reload, mandown, arrive (going into a building), loot (picked something up), chatter (the squad stands and talks), investigate (a patrol heard gunfire and goes to look), investigatedone (it found nothing and goes back to patrol).

npc-speech-military-contact-1 = Contact!
npc-speech-military-contact-2 = Hostile spotted!
npc-speech-military-contact-3 = Eyes on a target!
npc-speech-military-contact-4 = Movement, open fire!

npc-speech-military-clear-1 = Clear.
npc-speech-military-clear-2 = Area is clear.
npc-speech-military-clear-3 = Target down. Hold position.

npc-speech-military-reload-1 = Reloading!
npc-speech-military-reload-2 = Changing mags, cover me!
npc-speech-military-reload-3 = I'm out, reloading!

npc-speech-military-mandown-1 = Man down!
npc-speech-military-mandown-2 = We lost one!
npc-speech-military-mandown-3 = Man down, man down!

npc-speech-military-arrive-1 = Check the building.
npc-speech-military-arrive-2 = Sweep it. Move in.
npc-speech-military-arrive-3 = Spread out, check the corners.

npc-speech-military-loot-1 = Taking this along.
npc-speech-military-loot-2 = Might be useful.
npc-speech-military-loot-3 = Grab anything useful.

npc-speech-military-chatter-1 = Stay sharp.
npc-speech-military-chatter-2 = Quiet out here. Too quiet.
npc-speech-military-chatter-3 = Anyone else hear that?
npc-speech-military-chatter-4 = Keep your intervals.
npc-speech-military-chatter-5 = I hate this place.
npc-speech-military-chatter-6 = How long till relief?
npc-speech-military-chatter-7 = Watch your sectors.
npc-speech-military-chatter-8 = Whatever did this is still out there.

npc-speech-bandit-contact-1 = Got one!
npc-speech-bandit-contact-2 = Somebody's here!
npc-speech-bandit-contact-3 = Get 'em, boys!
npc-speech-bandit-contact-4 = Over there!

npc-speech-bandit-clear-1 = Heh. That's that.
npc-speech-bandit-clear-2 = Done with 'em.
npc-speech-bandit-clear-3 = Who's next?

npc-speech-bandit-reload-1 = Reloading!
npc-speech-bandit-reload-2 = Hold on, loading up!
npc-speech-bandit-reload-3 = Out of shells!

npc-speech-bandit-mandown-1 = They got one of us!
npc-speech-bandit-mandown-2 = Bastards!
npc-speech-bandit-mandown-3 = One of ours is down!

npc-speech-bandit-arrive-1 = Check the place. See what's inside.
npc-speech-bandit-arrive-2 = Look around. Anything good in there?
npc-speech-bandit-arrive-3 = Spread out. Find us something.

npc-speech-bandit-loot-1 = Mine now.
npc-speech-bandit-loot-2 = That'll sell.
npc-speech-bandit-loot-3 = Finders keepers.

npc-speech-bandit-chatter-1 = Cold as hell out here.
npc-speech-bandit-chatter-2 = When do we eat?
npc-speech-bandit-chatter-3 = Boss better pay up.
npc-speech-bandit-chatter-4 = Hear something?
npc-speech-bandit-chatter-5 = I'm bored.
npc-speech-bandit-chatter-6 = Keep your eyes open. Soldiers are about.
npc-speech-bandit-chatter-7 = Don't look at me like that.

npc-speech-military-investigate-1 = Shots fired. Moving to investigate.
npc-speech-military-investigate-2 = Gunfire. Check it out.
npc-speech-military-investigate-3 = Heard that. Move up, stay sharp.
npc-speech-military-investigate-4 = Possible contact. Move out.

npc-speech-military-investigatedone-1 = Nothing here. Back to patrol.
npc-speech-military-investigatedone-2 = Source not found. Resume.

npc-speech-bandit-investigate-1 = Hear that? Shooting. Let's go see.
npc-speech-bandit-investigate-2 = Somebody's got a gun out there. Move.
npc-speech-bandit-investigate-3 = That's gunfire. Could be loot. Could be trouble.
npc-speech-bandit-investigate-4 = Go look. Quietly.

npc-speech-bandit-investigatedone-1 = Nothing. Let's go.
npc-speech-bandit-investigatedone-2 = Whoever it was, they're gone.
